00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:16.416
Aww. Aunt Marianne lets us
finger-paint on the wall!

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.520
Entrepreneur Andrew Yang use
his opening statement tonigh

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
to differentiate himself
from President Trump, saying

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:28.161
"The opposite of Donald Trum
is an Asian man who likes math."

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.196 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.433
Which is a great point, but
actually think the opposit

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:38.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Trump would be a black gu
who is a good president.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There you go.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:48.515 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
Didn't know where you guys wer
gonna land on that one.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:54.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
